# Generated LexForge datasets
# Exclude raw JSONL datasets and oversized unused indexes
products/LexForge/dataset-compiler/output/*
products/LexForge/dataset-compiler/output/tmp/

# Include ONLY the compiled JSON indexes required by the runtime
!products/LexForge/dataset-compiler/output/semantic-index.json
!products/LexForge/dataset-compiler/output/ontology-index.json
!products/LexForge/dataset-compiler/output/definition-index.json